<title>USA: Delta Air uses new cargo booking system.</title>
<headline>Delta Air uses new cargo booking system.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Air Lines Inc said on Tuesday it started using a new system of booking cargo shipments on September 1, 1996.</p>
<p>Delta said the system, which was jointly developed by the airline and Unisys Corp, enables Delta Air Cargo representatives to maximize usage of cargo bin space by identifying available capacity on Delta's flights.</p>
<p>In the first six months of its operation as a business unit, Delta Air Cargo has shipped 2.1 million packages weighing 1.7 million pounds.</p>
